WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.500
I'm Ali Arshad. I work across business, software, AI, and creative production,
bringing multiple capabilities together through my personal studio.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:19.000
I help businesses turn ideas and operational challenges into practical digital solutions,
combining strategy, hands-on execution, and clear communication.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:32.000
My business administration and supply chain background helps me understand processes,
procurement, inventory, supplier coordination, and the commercial goals behind a project.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:44.000
For web development, I work with Next.js, Python, and FastAPI,
building responsive websites and applications backed by PostgreSQL databases.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:54.500
I use Docker, AWS, and Neon in my development and deployment workflows,
building CRM systems, inventory platforms, dashboards, and custom SaaS products.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:05.500
For AI and automation, I use n8n, Gemini, Ollama, and OpenRouter to connect applications,
automate repetitive work, and build intelligent workflows.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:17.500
I also develop AI agents and voice agent workflows for lead qualification,
customer support, information handling, and follow-ups, with human oversight when needed.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:27.500
For creative production, I use Premiere Pro and After Effects for video editing
and motion graphics, alongside Blender for three-dimensional visuals.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:37.500
With Photoshop and Illustrator, I create and refine brand assets, product imagery,
social media graphics, and professional visual content.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:51.000
I also handle social media management, LinkedIn prospect research, Sales Navigator,
and Dripify outreach, helping businesses strengthen their digital presence and generate opportunities.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:06.000
My portfolio brings these disciplines together through PipelineOS CRM, StockFlow Inventory,
Orexa, analytics platforms, creative campaigns, and automation projects.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:19.170
Need software, AI automation, creative production, or business solutions?
I bring strategy and execution together. One person, multiple disciplines. Let's build something great.
